infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Deploy order depends on the change direction
  desc Schema and code must stay compatible at every moment of the deploy
  compares
    - label Additive change
      children
        - label New column the new code reads
          desc Old code ignores it; new code finds it ready
        - label Run migration BEFORE deploying code
          desc Schema is ready when the new code lands
        - label Code-first would fail
          desc New code reads a column that does not exist yet
    - label Removal
      children
        - label Drop a column the old code reads
          desc Old code still queries it during the deploy
        - label Deploy code FIRST, drain, then migrate
          desc Old code stops using it before it disappears
        - label Migrate-first would fail
          desc Old in-flight code hits a non-existent column
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
